    "detailed_description": "Set in a decaying fantasy universe, follow Renard, Lysa and Amyline as they travel deeper into the world of their ancestors, pursued by a mysterious and unrelenting force. Exodus Idle is an idle game in which you can:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Loot and upgrade equipment<br></li><li> Hunt creatures to acquire resources<br></li><li> Fight strategic monster battles, where learning the enemy's attack patterns is key<br></li><li> Manage resource collection with tradeskills <br></li><li> Construct buildings to increase your global abilities<br></li><li> Spend resources to grow stronger<br></li><li> Progress both offline and actively<br></li><li> Unlock achievements<br></li><li> Read the built-in novelisation (yes, seriously - targeting 50,000+ words!)</li></ul><br>Join the Discord for updates and discussions: <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974030/extras/b5fd185e4bd919671e5e5b43b6f40a50.avif?t=1682002028\" /></div>",
